Package: qt6-5compat
Version: @DEB_QT5COMPAT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative
Description: Qt 6 compatibility library for Qt 5 APIs on the Xios desktop
 Qt5Compat carries APIs removed from Qt 6, most importantly QTextCodec and
 the wide codec set, plus the Qt5Compat.GraphicalEffects QML module that
 Plasma and Kirigami themes still use.
 .
 Required by KDE Frameworks (KIO) in the KDE Plasma Mobile flavor of the
 Xios desktop.
